/// Calendar dimension for the Regional Sales Performance Dashboard. Range = full calendar years from the first Order Date to the last Order/Ship Date (derived dynamically). Fiscal year starts in April (change _FYStartMonth). Offsets and flags are relative to the last Order Date.
